task: sentence_english_translation
instructions: |
  Translate each Hindi sentence into natural English. Preserve meaning and
  politeness markers such as ji where relevant.

  Return raw YAML only. Do not wrap the response in markdown fences. Do not add
  prose before or after the YAML.

  Required shape:
  results:
    - id: "0001"
      english: "..."
items:
{{#each items}}
  - id: "{{id}}"
    hindi: "{{hindi}}"
    romanisation: "{{romanisation}}"
{{/each}}
